	"title"		"原版化学扩展 / Vanilla Chemistry Expansion"
	"description"		"Not a big mod, but a lot of mechanics. Bug reports, code, suggestions and wishes are welcome in the comments or the QQ group: https://qm.qq.com/q/imekxahuBW

You can buy alcohol, but you can't brew your own bootleg?
Pumping out 2000 Dream Dust a day, and not even Wilde at level 3 plus Intimidating can keep you out of trouble?
Droppers and measuring cylinders all over the bench, yet the only way to pure acid and base is fish?
All you can do with nuclear waste is dump it at the junkyard, where someone just picks it back up?

This mod builds on real-world chemical production to give vanilla chemistry more to do, so late in the game you can lean into being a chemist through (somewhat) involved chemistry.

Main features:
1. [b]New![/b] Brine electrolysis: order rock salt, electrolyse brine into base, hydrogen and chlorine, burn the gases into hydrogen chloride and dissolve it into acid. Pure acid and base in bulk, no fish required!
2. Hollow's Lantern: grow a lab-bred chili and refine a legal riot-control incapacitant. Sell it to the Upper Level or Security and your crimes disappear; once they are gone, the investigation slows too.
3. Dream Toxin: the legal product of Dream Caps, a high-end cosmetic treatment for the Upper Level.
4. Grow Xinke and refine the alkaloid in its leaves into Crackine. Pharma-grade product brings addicts back every day, with a bigger budget each time.
5. Blend nutrifruit, brew beer with acid and yeast, and serve chilled draft beer!
6. Make alcohol from starch and sugar, ethyl acetate from plant matter, and edit genes so other crops make sugar and starch. Deep-space wine merchant: probably blended.
7. Crush ore and use the minerals to purify the acid and base the profiteers sell you.
8. Neutralize nuclear waste, extract the plutonium, and make Nuclear Cola!

More chemistry is planned; I just need a little inspiration.
Gunsmiths may also want: Ammo Printer https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3831394883

[h2]Vanilla Chemistry Expansion[/h2]
Built on the vanilla chemistry system (extraction, heating, refrigeration, filtering, evaporation, pressing); vanilla products and reactions are unchanged.

[h3]Advanced Chemistry Handbook[/h3]
Every procedure below is in the Advanced Chemistry Handbook. The chemist start comes with one; otherwise the retired chemist and Dr. Jackson sell it. Other mods can add chapters via the localization keys vce_handbook_title and vce_handbook_line_1..N.

[h3]Dream Toxin[/h3]
[list]
[*]Mix Dream Cap and Nightmare Cap extracts 1:1 with 0.5-5% acid and chill them in a powered fridge; the toxin survives boiling off the leftover extract.
[*]Press [b]Dream Toxin Injectors[/b]: legal, for Upper Level clinics, base value 150. Only pharma grade (90%+) pays: about as much as street Dream Dust, without the notoriety.
[/list]

[h3]Brine electrolysis (new)[/h3]
1 part salt + 0.3 part water ends up as 1 part base and 1 part acid, free of chemical contaminant and heavy metal.
[list]
[*][b]Rock salt ore[/b]: order 6 or 12 from GP Mining by phone. Any blender crushes it into about 80 mL of salt.
[*][b]Electrolyzer[/b]: sold by Dr. Jackson with two empty gas canisters. With a battery it electrolyses 240 mL of salt a night: base stays in the brine container, hydrogen and chlorine fill the canisters in products A and B. Takes universal modules.
[*][b]Gas canisters[/b] hold 5 L. Drag one onto another to merge gases; right-click to vent. Heat a hydrogen + chlorine canister past 120 C on a heating plate to burn it into hydrogen chloride, then drag it onto a container with water to make acid (up to 40%).
[/list]

[h3]Hollow's Lantern and Incapacitant[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Hollow's Lantern[/b]: an annual lab-bred chili, high-yielding but hungry, whose roots foul the water. Innate Capsaicin Production III gene; the retired farmer brings two seeds each visit.
[*]Blend the chilis into capsaicin, heat it with 4x as much alcohol to 50-78 C into Lantern Ester, dry it and press [b]A Small Vial of Incapacitant[/b] (2 mL, base value 28, graded like Dream Dust).
[*]Legal, medical and weapon. Only the Upper Level (private security included) and Security buy it; mercenaries take it as ordinary goods; everyone else refuses it.
[*][b]Wiping your record[/b]: each vial sold to the Upper Level or Security removes sold price x purity x 5 from your crimes, largest first; with no crimes left, every full 100 takes 1 off investigation progress.
[/list]

[h3]Xinke and Crackine[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Xinke[/b]: a perennial, drought-tolerant shrub that keeps growing leaves. The retired farmer brings seeds; the shady farmer sells leaves. Its Alkaloid Production gene can be spliced into other crops.
[*]Blend the leaves, remove the protein, add acid and boil dry into Crackine powder, then press [b]Crackine[/b] vials (level 2 contraband, a small vial worth about 1.5 Dream Dust).
[*][b]Regulars[/b]: a buyer who gets 90%+ real purity returns the next day, with 25% more budget each consecutive day (up to 2000) and ever more desperate lines.
[/list]

[h3]Ore Chemistry: purifying acid and base[/h3]
No filter removes the chemical contaminant and heavy metal in vanilla acid and base.
[list]
[*]Crush metal ore in a [b]blender with all 4 chem modules[/b] into calcite and quartz sand.
[*][b]Base[/b]: calcine calcite into quicklime and add it to base; heavy metal settles out of strong base.
[*][b]Acid[/b]: turn quartz sand into water glass, then silica gel, which drives the contaminant out of hot acid; freezing removes heavy metal. Needs an upgraded heating plate.
[/list]

[h3]Starch genes[/h3]
Nutrifruit's starch and sugar come from innate genes that can be spliced into other crops.

[h3]Industrial alcohol[/h3]
[list]
[*]Hydrolyse blended nutrifruit with acid, neutralize, and add yeast: it ferments overnight to 12-18% alcohol depending on the strain.
[*]Boil off methanol; freeze and filter out ice to concentrate the alcohol. The analyzer shows temperature; settings adjust boiling, fermentation and fridge speed.
[/list]

[h3]Blended wine[/h3]
[list]
[*]Turn plant matter into acetic acid and then ethyl acetate, and press it with alcohol and water into wine.
[*]Two labels you can change: quality and method (genuine/blended). False labels sold unnoticed add up to fraud; Upper Level clients refuse blended wine.
[/list]

[h3]Beer[/h3]
[list]
[*]The Chem Finisher fills alcoholic liquid into a 2 L [b]Beer Keg[/b], graded premium, ordinary or undrinkable.
[*]Double-click pours a [b]can[/b], or a [b]draft beer[/b] once chilled in the fridge. Draft sells best but goes flat overnight. Water buyers take beer too.
[/list]

[h3]Advanced Kotton fabric[/h3]
A gold Kotton fabric that regains full durability every day, found wherever the vanilla advanced water filter is.

[h3]Nuclear waste reprocessing[/h3]
[list]
[*]Pry open a nuclear waste barrel, dissolve the spent fuel in strong acid, add reducing agent, and extract the plutonium with ethyl acetate.
[*]Boil it dry into [b]Plutonium Ampoules[/b]; one on any drink makes a +50 Nuclear drink for Upper Level clients and addicts. Vitrify the leftover fission products with water glass.
[*][b]Radiation sickness[/b]: each night with opened waste costs 5% of selling prices (up to 25%); genuine Immunivax eases it. A Waste Broker sells barrels every 7 days.
[/list]

[h3]Compatibility[/h3]
No extra capabilities. Touches vanilla nutrifruit, metal ore, yeast, fridges, the analyzer, evaporator, heating plate, crowbars, Immunivax (usable with radiation sickness), water buyers, several shops and GP Mining's phone menu, and the security file (incapacitant sales). Before uninstalling, get rid of this mod's liquids and items."
	"changenote"		"1.6.0: New brine electrolysis line. Order rock salt from GP Mining (6 or 12) and crush it in any blender into salt. The Electrolyzer (sold by Dr. Jackson, with two empty gas canisters and instructions) electrolyses brine each night into base, hydrogen and chlorine. Gas canisters hold 5 L, merge by dragging and vent with right-click; heat hydrogen + chlorine past 120 C on a heating plate to make hydrogen chloride, then drag it onto a container with water for acid up to 40%. The retired chemist sometimes sells empty canisters; the handbook gets a Brine Electrolysis Notes chapter. Xinke's innate Alkaloid Production goes from II to III (seeds in existing saves are upgraded once). Fixes: Immunivax could not be injected for radiation sickness unless you had the Sentinel start; the incapacitant sale lines never showed (they now replace the deal line on every sale); plutonium ampoules could not be added to wine. / 1.6.0：新增电解食盐水。向 GP 矿业订购盐矿石（6 块 / 12 块），任何搅拌机都能打碎成食盐；电解机（杰克逊博士出售，自带两个空气罐和使用说明）每晚把食盐水电解成碱、氢气和氯气；气罐最多装 5 升，拖到另一个气罐上合并气体，右键放气；氢氯混合气放到加热板上烧到 120°C 以上生成氯化氢，拖到有水的容器上溶成最多 40% 的盐酸。退休化学家偶尔出售空气罐；手册新增“电解食盐水笔记”。新柯的“生物碱产出”天生等级从 II 提到 III（存档里已有的种子读档时一次性升级）。修复：非“哨兵”开局的玩家得了辐射病后右键免疫宁无法注射；失能剂卖给上层区和治安部时专属台词不显示（现在每笔交易都会顶替原版成交台词）；钚安瓿拖不进葡萄酒。"
}
